# Lychee Link Checker Configuration

This file tells lychee which URLs to skip. Use it for:
- Internal anchors that may not resolve in the checker
- Legitimate URLs that are temporarily blocked
- Links that require authentication
- Social media links that rate-limit the checker

See: https://github.com/lycheeverse/lychee#ignoring-links

# Example patterns (uncomment as needed):
# github.com/*/issues/new
# linkedin.com/.*
# instagram.com/.*
